{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15787","headline":"和耿拾遗元日观早朝 · 司空曙","name":"和耿拾遗元日观早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元日争朝阙，奔流若会溟。\n路尘和薄雾，骑火接低星。\n门响双鱼钥，车喧百子铃。\n冕旒当翠殿，幢戟满彤庭。\n积岁方编瑞，乘春即省刑。\n大官陈禹玉，司历献尧蓂。\n寿酒三觞退，箫韶九奏停。\n太阳开物象，霈泽及生灵。\n南陌高山碧，东方晓气青。\n自怜扬子贱，归草太玄经。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}